<title>JAPAN: HANDBALL-MEN'S WORLD HANDBALL CHAMPIONSHIP RESULTS.</title>
<headline>HANDBALL-MEN'S WORLD HANDBALL CHAMPIONSHIP RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>KUMAMOTO, Japan 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results in the knockout round of the mens world handball championship played on Tuesday:</p>
<p>Winning team's advance to Thursday's quarter finals.</p>
<p> Iceland	32  Norway     28 (halftime 13-15)</p>
<p> Spain	  31  Croatia    25 (16-14)</p>
<p> South Korea  37  Yugoslavia 33 (12-13)</p>
<p> Egypt	  24  Cuba	 20 (10-9)</p>
<p> Russia	 20   Tunisia    14 (12-5)</p>
<p> France	 22   Japan	21 (11-11)</p>
<p> Sweden	 32   Lithuania  20 (18-9)</p>
<p> Hungary	20   Czech Rep. 19 (11-9)</p>
</text>
